 * 01 : FNC_PRFM_NEWS_DATA_SUM_ISBS_OUT (A2_IS, A2_BS, A2_CMP)
 * 02 : FNC_PRFM_NEWS_DATA_IDX_IND_PRFM_OUT (A3)
 * 03 : FNC_PRFM_NEWS_DATA_RANK_OUT (A4, A5, A6, A7, A8, A9, A12)
